## Auto-Loaded FAQ Directory (`faqs/*.md` Dynamic Loader)

Every `.md` file placed inside `src/content/docs/mobile/support/faqs/` is automatically discovered and rendered below via `import.meta.glob('./faqs/*.md', { eager: true })`. To add a new FAQ pack, simply drop a new `.md` file into the `faqs/` folder:

{Object.entries(allFaqFiles).map(([filePath, mod]) => {
  const FaqContent = mod.default;
  const title = mod.frontmatter?.title || filePath.replace('./faqs/', '').replace('.md', '');
  return (
    <div class="portal-card" style="margin-bottom: 18px;">
      <div>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--portal-card-border, #1f3b2c); padding-bottom: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--portal-gold, #f3d17b);">{title}</span>
          <code style="font-size: 0.75rem;">{filePath.replace('./', '')}</code>
        </div>
        <FaqContent />
      </div>
    </div>
  );
})}

